## Paramètres importants

```python
SPHERE_RADIUS    = 0.05     # m
CUBE_HALF        = 0.05     # m
C_SQ             = 1.67e-3  # m²  (rayon de giration carré du cube)
FN_DESIRED       = 2.0      # N   (force normale cible)
V_PUSH           = 0.04     # m/s (vitesse tangentielle nominale)
K_F              = 0.15     # gain feedback delta_f
K_C              = 0.10     # gain feedback py
K_LAT            = 1.5      # correction latérale
NO_CONTACT_TIMEOUT = 5.0    # s
DONE_THRESHOLD   = 0.01     # m
MU_PUSHER        = 0.3      # coefficient friction pousseur-objet
```

